@page "/"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>ArchitectCoach</PageTitle>

<h1>ArchitectCoach</h1>
<p class="lead">
    Make the important architecture decisions before you build: what each option costs, how hard it
    is to deploy and secure, how far it scales, and what it means for compliance. Then download a
    GitHub Spec Kit–ready plan your own AI coding agent can build from.
</p>

<AuthorizeView>
    <Authorized>
        <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="projects">Go to my projects</a></p>
    </Authorized>
    <NotAuthorized>
        <p class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="Account/Register">Create a free account</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="Account/Login">Sign in</a>
        </p>
        <p class="small muted">Only your email address is stored. No AI runs on this site.</p>
    </NotAuthorized>
</AuthorizeView>
